    "rating": 4.5,
    "reference": "ChIJ4QSpzqM3yUwRRNlH19elpMo",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Allison Hédan",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117170984293806530153/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUOjwpofAfstilOe21UaZqomSNz3Qtm8k8fc2wt-g0oP9KxBCWNlg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Beautiful! The designs, decor and furniture were so lovely. Staff is welcoming and professional. We stayed in the elegant suit and the place was absolutely gorgeous. The only negative aspect was we visited last weekend of November, the room was particularly cold and there was no thermostat to make us comfortable.",
        "time": 1766857990,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ana A",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109396563176701349849/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW8BPXEV9sUGhd1qyf0CAseCuzYkWCLK-nmL5Bj5PiMNHgCDRM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Every year, we come back to Château Vaudreuil when visiting from out of the country. Mr. Sandro is very kind and helpful. We love all the staff and also would like to mention Ms. Loli, who, just like Mr. Sandro, takes a lot of pride in her job and always smiles. Our rooms are always spotless; therefore, we have decided to stay at the hotel twice a year instead of once. I hope the hotel will stay open for a long time because it’s difficult to find such beautiful properties in Montreal, West Island and surroundings. A huge thank you to all the staff for making this an exceptional stay.",
        "time": 1767176395,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Giraldo Juliana",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113615401382831489196/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVIo5gILbys1WscA8twjtHHMetsPZX5W_azhcXF-1yOAVd0eB4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "My husband and I had a perfect stay. Vincent and Ethienne at the bar were incredibly attentive and detail-oriented — truly outstanding service. I also want to highlight Mr. Sandro, whose kindness makes you feel at home the moment you walk into the hotel. The facilities are impeccably maintained, and every detail is thoughtfully designed for the guest. We’ll definitely be back!\nPd: Mr. George hosts live music on weekends — and it’s absolutely spectacular! 🎶",
        "time": 1762820960,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Sylvie Kong",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111104097577080723519/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJMu9g-0ZP_4vPbtsumsjj8YrjlG2oTeVNdUHeEGwmFN_AMeg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Went there for a wedding this summer,  the drinks were amazing and the food overall was great. The staff were super accommodating with food intolerances and gave us an alternative right away. Although the exterior looks a bit old, the inside is actually really nice. It was sunny during our visit, so we also got to enjoy the beautiful outdoor view. Great experience all around!",
        "time": 1759065802,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Negi N",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105273668660504738838/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVc_cwOMVMY8LvpLcw_CRSBMlEQPrUkChtfba0TPquDAFlV3vA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "A beautiful hotel with friendly, welcoming staff. Our room was spacious, comfortable, and well equipped with everything you need. Everything was great overall, but we wished the restaurant on Sunday stayed open a bit longer , bc it closed at 2:30 PM, which felt a little early for a hotel where many guests are travelers who might need a meal later in the day. Still, you could order room service, which was a nice option.",
        "time": 1760446770,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
